title: Terry_Advisor
---
Terry: Ugh, Francy, did I tell you I had another meeting with my advisor? Soooooo boring. Are yours like that?
You have never had a meeting with an advisor from this college, as you are not an enrolled student in this college – in fact, you try to avoid academic advisors at all costs. They can do things like look up your name and realize you have no transcript. Or government ID. Or birth certificate.
Francine: …yes.
Terry: Yeah, I knew you’d get it. She’s always on my ass like, “ooo, Terrence, are you gonna graduate on time,” and “ooo, Terrence, you can’t just take five unrelated electives a semester” and “ooo, Terrence, I don’t understand what you intend to gain out of your academic career with this course load.” Nerd shit like that, you know?
Francine: Are you not going to graduate on time?
Terry: I don’t know, because as established, I’m not a nerd. This is what’s wrong with education, man. You’re so obsessed with grades. You’re just like my advisor.

===
